---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout description="Soraya Rose Studio is a boutique interior design practice creating timeless, elegant interiors across London and the Home Counties."
  header="overlay">
  <section class="relative flex min-h-[92vh] items-center justify-center overflow-hidden text-white">
    <div class="photo absolute inset-0" style="--img:url('/images/home-hero.jpg')" role="img" aria-label="A warm, elegant living room by Soraya Rose Studio"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-black/50 via-black/25 to-black/45"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10 px-6 pt-16 text-center">
      <span class="monogram text-[7rem] sm:text-[9rem]" aria-hidden="true"><span>S</span><span>R</span></span>
      <p class="mt-8 font-display text-3xl font-light uppercase tracking-[0.3em] sm:text-5xl">Soraya Rose</p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.6em]">Studio</p>
      <span class="mx-auto my-6 block h-px w-24 bg-white/60"></span>
      <p class="text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.5em]">Interior Design</p>
    </div>
    <a href="#intro" class="absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 z-10 -translate-x-1/2 text-white/80 hover:text-white" aria-label="Scroll to content">
      <svg class="h-10 w-6 animate-bounce" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" viewBox="0 0 24 40" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2v34M4 28l8 8 8-8"/></svg>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section id="intro" class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-10 lg:py-28">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto_1fr] lg:items-center lg:gap-16">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow text-taupe">Luxury interiors. Timeless spaces.</p>
        <h1 class="mt-5 font-display text-5xl font-light leading-[1.05] lg:text-7xl">Thoughtfully designed.<br><em>Beautifully lived.</em></h1>
      </div>
      <span class="hidden h-32 w-px bg-ink/20 lg:block"></span>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/75">Soraya Rose Studio is a boutique interior design practice specialising in creating timeless, elegant and beautifully considered interiors across London and the Home Counties.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 pb-24 lg:px-10 lg:pb-32">
    <div class="grid gap-x-6 gap-y-14 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <a href="/our-story/" class="group block text-center">
        <div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="photo aspect-[4/5] transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" style="--img:url('/images/home-card-story.jpg')" aria-hidden="true"></div></div>
        <h3 class="mt-6 font-display text-2xl uppercase tracking-[0.15em]">Our Story</h3>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-[15rem] text-[0.7rem] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.2em] text-taupe">The people, passion and philosophy behind the studio</p>
        <span class="link-arrow mt-5">Discover more <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
      </a>
      <a href="/services/" class="group block text-center">
        <div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="photo aspect-[4/5] transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" style="--img:url('/images/home-card-services.jpg')" aria-hidden="true"></div></div>
        <h3 class="mt-6 font-display text-2xl uppercase tracking-[0.15em]">Our Services</h3>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-[15rem] text-[0.7rem] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.2em] text-taupe">Bespoke interiors, tailored to you</p>
        <span class="link-arrow mt-5">Explore services <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
      </a>
      <a href="/portfolio/" class="group block text-center">
        <div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="photo aspect-[4/5] transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" style="--img:url('/images/home-card-portfolio.jpg')" aria-hidden="true"></div></div>
        <h3 class="mt-6 font-display text-2xl uppercase tracking-[0.15em]">Portfolio</h3>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-[15rem] text-[0.7rem] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.2em] text-taupe">A collection of our latest projects</p>
        <span class="link-arrow mt-5">View portfolio <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
      </a>
      <a href="/blog/" class="group block text-center">
        <div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="photo aspect-[4/5] transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" style="--img:url('/images/home-card-blog.jpg')" aria-hidden="true"></div></div>
        <h3 class="mt-6 font-display text-2xl uppercase tracking-[0.15em]">Blog</h3>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-[15rem] text-[0.7rem] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.2em] text-taupe">Inspiration, insights and ideas</p>
        <span class="link-arrow mt-5">Read the blog <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-sand">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="photo min-h-[420px] lg:min-h-[640px]" style="--img:url('/images/home-living.jpg')" role="img" aria-label="An elegant entrance hall"></div>
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-center px-6 py-16 lg:px-20">
        <p class="eyebrow text-taupe">Interiors that feel like home</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-light leading-tight lg:text-5xl">Beautifully considered <em>living</em></h2>
        <span class="my-8 block h-px w-16 bg-ink/30"></span>
        <div class="space-y-5 leading-relaxed text-ink/75">
          <p>The studio brings together a shared passion for exceptional design, refined aesthetics and meticulous attention to detail. With a wealth of experience spanning luxury residential developments, architectural interior design and high-end hospitality, we offer a personal and collaborative approach to every project.</p>
          <p>We believe that truly beautiful interiors should be more than simply visually captivating. They should reflect the individuality of those who inhabit them, balancing effortless sophistication with comfort, practicality and a sense of belonging.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-10"><a href="/our-story/" class="btn">Our story <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="order-2 flex flex-col justify-center px-6 py-16 lg:order-1 lg:px-20">
        <p class="eyebrow text-taupe">Our signature aesthetic</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-light leading-tight lg:text-5xl">Timeless, <em>enduring</em> elegance</h2>
        <span class="my-8 block h-px w-16 bg-ink/30"></span>
        <div class="space-y-5 leading-relaxed text-ink/75">
          <p>From complete home transformations and extensive renovations to individual room designs, our approach is tailored to each client&rsquo;s vision, lifestyle and aspirations.</p>
          <p>Our signature aesthetic embraces timeless elegance, natural materials, rich textures and carefully curated details. Whether creating a contemporary retreat or reimagining a traditional residence, we strive to achieve interiors that feel effortlessly luxurious, harmonious and enduring.</p>
          <p>At Soraya Rose Studio, we pride ourselves on building lasting relationships with our clients, guiding them through the design journey with creativity, expertise and an unwavering commitment to quality.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-10"><a href="/services/" class="btn">Our services <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="photo order-1 min-h-[420px] lg:order-2 lg:min-h-[640px]" style="--img:url('/images/home-aesthetic.jpg')" role="img" aria-label="Natural materials and rich textures in a finished interior"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-24 text-center lg:py-32">
    <span class="monogram text-5xl text-taupe" aria-hidden="true"><span>S</span><span>R</span></span>
    <blockquote class="mt-10 font-display text-3xl font-light italic leading-snug lg:text-5xl">&ldquo;Our philosophy is simple: to create exceptional spaces that are as beautiful to live in as they are to look at.&rdquo;</blockquote>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 pb-24 lg:px-10">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-6">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow text-taupe">Featured projects</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl font-light lg:text-5xl">Recent work</h2>
      </div>
      <a href="/portfolio/" class="link-arrow">View all projects <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <a href="/portfolio/" class="group block overflow-hidden" aria-label="View portfolio"><div class="photo aspect-[4/3] transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" style="--img:url('/images/portfolio-01.jpg')" aria-hidden="true"></div></a>
      <a href="/portfolio/" class="group block overflow-hidden" aria-label="View portfolio"><div class="photo aspect-[4/3] transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" style="--img:url('/images/portfolio-02.jpg')" aria-hidden="true"></div></a>
      <a href="/portfolio/" class="group block overflow-hidden" aria-label="View portfolio"><div class="photo aspect-[4/3] transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" style="--img:url('/images/portfolio-03.jpg')" aria-hidden="true"></div></a>
      <a href="/portfolio/" class="group block overflow-hidden" aria-label="View portfolio"><div class="photo aspect-[4/3] transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" style="--img:url('/images/portfolio-04.jpg')" aria-hidden="true"></div></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
